title: $:/plugins/linonetwo/opened-tiddlers-bar/changelog
caption: Changelog

! Changelog

!! v1.2.0 (2026-04-28)

* refactor: split `style.css.tid` into pure `style.css`+`style.css.meta` and `style.color.tid` for dynamic theme-dependent rules
* fix: remove bottom border on bar that looked visually awkward

!! v1.1.0 (2026-04-27)

* fix [[#4|https://github.com/tiddly-gittly/opened-tiddlers-bar/issues/4]]: Dark mode — bar background now follows TiddlyWiki theme color instead of hardcoded white
* fix [[#6|https://github.com/tiddly-gittly/opened-tiddlers-bar/issues/6]]: Sidebar toggle button obscured — `.tc-topbar-right` now positioned below bar height dynamically
* fix [[#7|https://github.com/tiddly-gittly/opened-tiddlers-bar/issues/7]]: Long tab titles now truncate with ellipsis; full title shown on hover tooltip
* fix [[#9|https://github.com/tiddly-gittly/opened-tiddlers-bar/issues/9]]: Bar is hidden on mobile viewports (≤768px) to save vertical space
* fix [[#2|https://github.com/tiddly-gittly/opened-tiddlers-bar/issues/2]]: Tabs are now draggable to reorder via TiddlyWiki `$draggable`/`$droppable` widgets
* feat: add Playwright automated tests covering all fixed issues

!! v1.0.0

* Initial release
